classification for the talon:

  talon SIZE          PUBLIC      -- node.talon_size, an int
  talon COMPOSITION   HIDDEN      -- no field holds cards;
                                     unconstructible, not refused
  future DRAW ORDER   split:
     which player draws first  -- rule constant + public seat
     which CARDS they draw     -- HIDDEN, and never consulted

  source, information_set.py line 37:
    'The talon's contents and order are hidden; only its size
     is public.'

  Model C therefore uses only: own_cards, opponent_cards,
  talon_size, refill_to, searcher_is_attacker. All permitted.
